#: ../../tools/channelsdb_tools.rst:32 0788eac492e348ec889de5c84cbdf7c6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get cofactor access tunnel data for a PDB structure from"
" ChannelsDB. Specifically detects tunnels that provide access pathways "
"for cofactors and small molecules to reach enzyme active sites or binding"
" pockets. Each channel includes geometric profile data (radius along the "
"path, 3D coordinates), physicochemical properties (charge, "
"hydrophobicity, polarity), and the residue layers that line the tunnel. "
"Use ChannelsDB\\_get\\_channels\\_pdb for a complete view of all channel "
"types including transmembrane pores and reviewed channels."
msgstr ""

